<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS share index closes at record 516.63.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS share index closes at record 516.63.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index closed at a record 516.63 on Monday on a robust $68 million total market turnover, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>The index closed on Friday at 509.47, the previous record.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
